    "Name": "Savage Wolf",
    "Details": "A RISC redesign of recovered early Savage Wolf prototypes, the PR-RISC was often used for false-flag operations or traps behind enemy lines. With one Hyper laser in each arm, the 'Mech has to carry extra coolant pods to handle the immense heat build up.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.18</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
